    "created_at": "2015-10-16T11:53:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-16T11:53:09Z",
    "body": "\"It, and its ::backdrop pseudo-element, are not rendered if its inclusive ancestor has the display property set to none.\" is a duplicate if `::backdrop` already has the same requirements. I think we should fix this as suggested by @upsuper above, instead of having the `::backdrop` section act as if it were an element for the purposes of this section.\n",
